{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14103190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317201:":{"text":"여왕님이시여, 이 거친 석재를 하사해 주시옵소서.","source_cn":"女王在上，赐予这些粗糙的石材——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9655D96E9271F7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317202:":{"text":"또 시작이네! 허구헌 날 여왕 얘기야.","source_cn":"又来了！整天把女王挂嘴边","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE41F49740502B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317203:":{"text":"흥, 우리가 없었다면...","source_cn":"哼，没有我们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x336D269101E7B812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317204:":{"text":"어라? 저건 조아 아주머니?","source_cn":"诶？那不是祖娅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE04667E5DF2FCA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317205:":{"text":"조아 아주머니~!","source_cn":"祖娅——姑姑——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B1947C9215BCE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410319001:0":{"text":"조아 아주머니... 정말 조아 아주머니신가요?","source_cn":"祖娅姑姑……真的是祖娅姑姑吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60DA3B3B6C1F320E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410319002:1":{"text":"네? 아주머니라고요...?","source_cn":"啊，姑姑……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B3A6C6AD04AF44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410319003:1":{"text":"아주머니! 정말 아주머니시군요! 헥토르 님이시여... 정말 믿을 수 없어요!","source_cn":"姑姑！真是你！赫托在下……我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1CF05C71DE5D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410319004:1":{"text":"어... 사, 사람 잘못 보셨어요!","source_cn":"呃……你、你认错人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EC04E1E0212ACAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410319005:1":{"text":"그럴 리가요? 저예요, 핀! 예전에 제가 아주머니 술을 훔쳐 먹어서 맞은 등짝 스매싱을 아직도 기억하는걸요!","source_cn":"怎么会？是我啊！芬恩！小时候我偷喝你的酒，还被你狠狠打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AF4F8E26D9ABFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410319006:1":{"text":"헥토르 님이시여, <style=\"highlight\">아주머니께선 백 년 전이랑 달라진 게 하나도 없으시네요!</style>","source_cn":"赫托啊，<style=highlight>你长得简直和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x658026E8EA7707B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410319007:1":{"text":"그동안 어디에 계셨어요? 아무런 소식도 없었잖아요! 플린은 아무 말도 없었고요.","source_cn":"这么些年你去哪了？一点消息都没有！弗林什么都不肯说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169C4B8690C4F3AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410319008:1":{"text":"그러고 보니, 아주머니가 떠나신 후에 플린이 촌장이 되었어요. 제 생각엔...","source_cn":"说起来，你走之后，弗林就当上了村长。要我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75555A3578929D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410319009:1":{"text":"거기 지상 사람! 잡담할 여유 있으면 어서 일이나 해! 게으름 피우지 말고!","source_cn":"地表人！你还有闲心聊天？快干活！不要偷懒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B34FD2ABD75611","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410319010:1":{"text":"이봐, 지금 누구더러 그러는 거야? 난 너희의 하인이 아니니 말 조심해!","source_cn":"嘿，你说谁呢？我可不是你们的仆从！放尊重点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCB0B29D5C9C57C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410319011:1":{"text":"잊지 마, 깊은바위 수정을 원한 건 너희 드워프들이었어! 여왕님께서 은혜를 베풀지 않으셨다면 너희는 아무것도 가져가지 못했을 거라고!","source_cn":"别忘了，是你们矮人喊着求着想要深岩晶！如果不是女王开恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2CBC82BB40116F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410319012:1":{"text":"우리의 마법이 없었다면 너희가 만든 물건은 전부 쓸모없는 것에 불과해!","source_cn":"没有我们的魔法，你们造的东西不过是堆死石头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3999C927B1FB083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410319013:1":{"text":"뭐라고?! 우리 드워프가 아니었다면 너희 뾰족귀들은 비바람을 피할 곳도 없었을 거야.","source_cn":"哈？！要不是我们矮人，你们这群尖耳朵怕是连个遮风挡雨的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6A045918ECA32C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410319014:1":{"text":"이 아치형 문과 기둥을 좀 보라고, 전부 우리 조상들께서 피땀 흘려 만드신 거잖아!","source_cn":"瞧瞧这些拱门和立柱，哪一块不是我们祖辈的心血？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D06CA59C41E39F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410319015:1":{"text":"말 조심해. 너희 지상 종족을 신성한 공사에 참여하게 해준 것도 이미 크나큰 은혜니까.","source_cn":"注意你的语气。让你们这些地表种族参与神圣工程，已是莫大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB512C16713134F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410319016:1":{"text":"됐거든! 신전을 짓는 것이야말로 신성한 공사지, 너희를 위해 왕성을 재건하는 게 무슨 신성한 일이라고!","source_cn":"得了吧！建神殿才是神圣工程，给你们修王城算什么神圣？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDECE6E8F31682D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410319017:1":{"text":"왜? 은혜의 이슬 몇 모금 마셨다고 네가 신이라도 된 줄 아는 거야?","source_cn":"怎么，喝几口灵露就把自己当神了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8FAF3F070F67EB2F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"왜? 은혜의 이슬 몇 모금 마셨다고 네가 신이라도 된 줄 아는 거야?","female":"왜? 은혜의 이슬 몇 모금 마셨다고 네가 신이라도 된 줄 아는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"157015","variant_female_record_index":"157016","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410319018:1":{"text":"조용히 해! 어서 가서 석재나 준비해!","source_cn":"闭嘴！快去准备石材！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5ACB9CEB15938BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410319019:1":{"text":"아니? 난 쉬어야겠어!","source_cn":"我偏不——我要休息了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCD38B18BE86D3D9C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아니? 난 쉬어야겠어!","female":"아니? 난 쉬어야겠어!","variant_male_record_index":"157018","variant_female_record_index":"157019","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410319020:1":{"text":"그래? 그럼 영원히 쉬도록 해!","source_cn":"你！那你就永远地休息吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8753B8F60618BD17","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래? 그럼 영원히 쉬도록 해!","female":"그래? 그럼 영원히 쉬도록 해!","variant_male_record_index":"157021","variant_female_record_index":"157022","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410319021:0":{"text":"그만해, 싸우지 말라고!","source_cn":"住手，先别打——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x738120BE51BDBFD9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그만해, 싸우지 말라고!","female":"그만해, 싸우지 말라고!","variant_male_record_index":"157023","variant_female_record_index":"157024","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:36:14010399:0":{"text":"돌에 축복을 하던 에세일 제사장이 옆에 있던 드워프와 언쟁을 벌였다. 우리가 그곳을 지나가던 중, 언쟁을 벌이던 드워프가 조아를 알아봤다.","source_cn":"艾塞勒祭司对着石材祝祷时，与旁边的矮人吵了起来。你们恰...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1D5D915691073670","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"돌에 축복을 하던 에세일 제사장이 옆에 있던 드워프와 언쟁을 벌였다. 우리가 그곳을 지나가던 중, 언쟁을 벌이던 드워프가 조아를 알아봤다.","female":"돌에 축복을 하던 에세일 제사장이 옆에 있던 드워프와 언쟁을 벌였다. 우리가 그곳을 지나가던 중, 언쟁을 벌이던 드워프가 조아를 알아봤다.","variant_male_record_index":"168142","variant_female_record_index":"168143","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:附魔的祭司":{"text":"마법에 걸린 사제","source":"附魔的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:劳作的矮人":{"text":"일하는 드워프","source":"劳作的矮人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:芬恩":{"text":"핀","source":"芬恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":32,"localized_text_count":27,"speaker_count":6}}